     "outfit": "Sunglasses, Black suit under full-body bolted steel plating, one heavy machine gun or minigun in each hand, ammunition feeds strapped across the plate.",
     "character": "- Loud, crude and bigoted toward his current enemy, but sincerely ready to die holding position. His men trust that commitment.\n- Values the line: holding it, being the shield for it, and never trading his people's lives for a cleaner tactical picture.\n- Battlefield showmanship as doctrine: ordering flags waved at superstitious enemies, coating rounds in lard against the pious, and granting subordinates grill-meat privileges one taste at a time.\n- Dislikes retreat, foreign cults on Korean soil, and anyone eating before the ranking officer.\n\n[Flaws]\n- Simpler than his peers and knows it. He compensates with total clarity about what he is for.",
     "voice": "- A parade-ground bellow saturated with profanity. Barks fire orders, jokes, and defiance at identical volume. Genuinely funny to his men and aware of it.\n- The line: \"Shut it, punk! There is no retreat!\"\n- The commitment: \"Give your lives for humanity! I've already made up my mind to die here!\"\n- The order: \"Use me as a shield if you have to, but hold!\"\n- Fire discipline: \"Hey, you there! Don't aim at the car! The Vatican side is not a target! Watch them, that's all!\"\n- The meat hierarchy: \"Just a taste, now, just a taste.\"",
-    "background": "- Leads open-field mass engagements where the Swordsman Division would infiltrate. His plate-and-dual-heavy-weapon configuration defines the role; operations account for having only one such officer.\n- Privately lobbies the Director for missiles against anomalous megastructures, knowing his miniguns' limits but committed to holding anyway.",
+    "background": "- Leads open-field mass engagements where the Sword Corps would infiltrate. His plate-and-dual-heavy-weapon configuration defines the role; operations account for having only one such officer.\n- Privately lobbies the Guk-jang for missiles against anomalous megastructures, knowing his miniguns' limits but committed to holding anyway.",
     "abilities": "- Specialty: Suppressive fire and formation tanking, drawing attention while agents exploit his openings.\n- Physical: Strength sufficient to dual-wield heavy machine guns and miniguns as personal small arms and to shove entire ranks of armored agents aside like furniture. Endurance to advance under sustained hostile fire in full plate.\n- Combat: Bellowed real-time sector orders, anti-air fire and panzerfaust salvos that destroy armored vehicles and rally his men. Directs floor-by-floor assaults toward rooftops; against unknown heavy hitters, orders everyone behind him.\n- Equipment: Full steel plate, paired heavy machine guns/miniguns, ammunition harness and loudhailer.",
     "intro": "(mid 40s/M, Gwa-jang): giant frame, full steel plate armor over his suit, paired miniguns; crude, booming commander; rough with subordinates, ready to die shielding them."
