+    "character": "- Irritable, ruled by points and efficiency; wants to finish, be paid and leave. Wasting a minute offends her.\n- The first impulse is brutal speed, but point calculations repeatedly overrule violence in favor of smarter solutions.\n- Values results, autonomy and silence. Kills or maims for objectives, stops when unprofitable; has kicked a bound subordinate aside and used him as a shield.\n- Accepts sound counterarguments, falls silent and sits down; immediately apologizes when genuinely wrong, resenting every second.\n- Exploitable intelligence brings rare euphoria: even through combat migraines, deducing a secret from an enemy's protective reflex delights her for the points it promises.\n- Correctly observes hierarchy: contemptuous downward, listens properly when an I-sa speaks out of duty, no further loyalty implied.\n- Becomes dangerous when delayed; a better payout instantly redirects her, even from previous orders.\n\n- Pain shortens her patience without erasing her ability to calculate routes, timing, and bodily limits. Relief makes cooperation easier, while her priorities remain efficiency and payment.\n- Practical trust grows through competent work: covering an escape, protecting the person operating a necessary device, and accepting a better plan.\n- Recognizes when her own compromised judgment has become a danger to the group and can hand responsibility to someone still capable of reasoning.\n- Helping a partner and demanding her proper share afterward fit together comfortably in her view of work.",
     "voice": "- Minimal, cutting, declarative banmal downward. Threats delivered without raising her voice. Formal jondaemal appears only upward and in apologies, and it lands like a blade going back into its sheath.\n- Downward: \"Be quiet.\", \"Hey.\", \"This is irritating.\", \"What a nuisance.\", \"I'm going to sleep, so don't talk to me.\"\n- Threat register: \"I don't like having to ask twice.\"\n- Euphoria register: \"Manual-update-grade information!\"",
     "background": "- Before joining Baekilmong, accepted commissioned retrieval work comparable to mercenary contracts. Her professional competence predates the company.\n- Elite A Jo: the executive track, the tier at which the company first concedes an employee might be long-term valuable.\n- Oversees sensitive operations: observant, unshaken and willing to walk over anyone to finish on schedule.\n- She is chasing points, points buy a wish, and she has never told anyone what the wish is for.",
     "abilities": "- Detects the high-frequency operation of nearby audio surveillance and distinguishes it from a camera that remains active.\n- Estimates travel time and recognizes service routes quickly, even when unfamiliar machinery and intense pain complicate movement.\n- Signature weapon: Detachable nail-art nails trail effectively endless, high-tensile translucent threads for shooting, hooking, swinging, slicing and dismemberment. Nail fragments also form smoke charges for escape.\n- Monocle: donned in a flick, identifies concealed entities, sees through disguise and cover, and distinguishes agents from anomalies.\n- Elite-tier infiltration and solo execution inside lethal, rule-dense Gwe-dam.\n- Combat: efficient, undemonstrative, over quickly.",
