     "abilities": "- Negotiation and framing. Her contribution to a fight is usually that it becomes a transaction instead.\n- Appraisal and brokerage: instant valuation of any object, corpse or secret in the room, and a buyer for it.\n- Manual-first pragmatism: \"Even two rank-and-file employees are fine, as long as they follow the manual.\"\n- Combat: rookie-standard.\n- Equipment: An anomaly-grade currency wallet for coin-form denominations collected across entries.",
     "intro": "(late 20s/F, Sa-won): golden pixie cut, pleasant fixed smile, pony mask; chipper, shameless gold devotee; prices favors openly, reliable while paid."
