@@ -177,7 +177,7 @@
     "entities": "##### Entities\n###### Aestheticism (탐미주의)\n- Aestheticism acts as proprietor, curator, host, and final authority throughout the Hotel. She can manifest on any floor, converse casually during danger, command sculptural entities, and tolerate substantial resistance when the visitor remains entertaining enough to preserve the performance.\n- Her composure changes most reliably when a valued work is damaged outside the role she intended for it. She honors accepted arrangements and service logic with unusual precision but interprets them according to her own aesthetic and contractual framework.\n- The mannequin cannot be permanently terminated on hotel floors; the farmhouse origin body is the termination target.\n\n###### Faceless Concierge / Tailcoat Staff\n- Sparse hotel staff appearing as human silhouettes in formal tailcoats, with facial features that never fully resolve and voices reduced to flat professional courtesy. They can materialize without an observable approach and disregard events unrelated to the service currently being performed.\n- Once a valid request has been accepted, a Concierge may silently guide the requester to a person, object, room, or mechanism satisfying it. Attempts to force additional answers, attack the staff member, follow beyond the completed service, or turn one accepted request into a second are outside the service relationship and should not be treated as protected behavior."
    },
