     "rules": "##### Contact and Wish Hazards\n- Building-Grade Absorption: prolonged contact, deliberate touching, or being forced against architecture without permission converts a person into furniture within seconds to minutes. Neutralizing the building does not reverse it.\n- Wall-Ejection Strike: The building can eject completed furniture-subjects from its walls. A converted human formed into a fixture such as a lamp can be expelled violently, bursting into blood-spatter as the occupied section of wall resets.\n- Room labels actively mislead; do not infer safety from reassuring names or use the designated Safe Room as shelter.\n- Pinwheel Wish Inversion: audible wishes within range receive catastrophic fulfillment. Saving a cut-throat victim may merge them into a wall; wishing a mother health may turn her into a plague core. Silent wishes have no effect. Ignore the recorder and speak no wishes for rescue, healing, protection, or survival near the object.",
     "entities": "##### Irreversible Furniture Victims\n###### Absorbed Furniture-Staff\n- Former teachers or director-level staff absorbed while fleeing or issuing commands and converted into partially human architectural fixtures such as lamps, beams, chair backs, and door handles. Most remain passive and should be treated as anomaly objects rather than recoverable victims.\n- Intact removal to an external staging area is possible, but no known reversal path exists. Mercy killing should be considered only when a form remains audibly conscious and suffering or when the route cannot otherwise be cleared."
