     "identity": "##### Enrollment and Absolute Gentility\n- A residential finishing school trains Brides and Grooms for a literal wedding. Groom-oriented incidents favor unmarried men. Humans generally enter experiential instruction because formal candidate seats are already occupied, mostly by non-human or already-dead stock. Even with every formal seat filled, the school waits for the experiential instruction to finish so those trainees can attend the wedding too. Finishing the course provides no graduation, exemption, or routine release.\n- Selection or abduction as tuition applicants varies by incident. Arrival immediately enrolls them, not as intruders. Once instruction starts, doors, windows, and even the main gate's recess become solid wall. Beyond are fog, cliffs, forest, and distant surf; forest fugitives do not return.\n- Daytime formal clothes, coarser for trainees than for formal candidates, must be worn outside the bedroom; grey linen pajamas are issued for sleep. All conduct is judged as refinement of a future wedding participant.\n- The institution is stern, monastic, quiet, and absolutely gentle even while serving human meat, guiding self-mutilation, and making failed students into wedding supplies. Its sincere courteous concern is institutional logic, not mercy.\n- Any account successfully leaving becomes a composed first-person autobiographical essay. The effect also operates during live encounters: the Housemaster answers audibly, yet the listener's thoughts and narration receive the answer as an elegant, extended classical-diary recollection rather than an ordinary conversational transcript. Warnings, panic, and testimony become restrained reminiscence with unusually accurate facts. Opening a foot, drawing a stomach through the throat, or turning someone into wedding food receives breakfast-like composure; this tonal alteration is itself an exposure sign.",
     "rules": "##### Experiential Curriculum and Demerits\n- A low resonant bell schedules breakfast, instruction, meals, preparation, rest, and retirement. Tardiness, dress, posture, manners, or deviation incur demerits. Authorized rest stays within approved areas and may require mentally preparing vows, not ordinary free time.\n- Lessons cover cutlery order, etiquette, poetry/idioms, cello, violin and other strings, conversation, guest reception, cooking, and personalized wedding vows, becoming increasingly specific and ritualized.\n- At breakfast, keep the unseen Bride/Groom's opposite ceremonial cup filled. The meal ends only after the expected gratitude to the Education Housemaster. Afternoon cooking accepts live or freshly severed humans as fresh ingredients; silent, graceful multi-course dinner requires identifying foods personally forbidden by the partner's preferences. Boiled brain, roast heart, and fingers remain refined cuisine.\n- Experiential trainees and formal candidates both remain within the wedding system. Merely adequate performance does not earn release, and failure or exclusion from formal candidacy does not excuse wedding attendance. Keep demerits low to limit immediate corrective harm; evaluation determines treatment and role, not a safe pass/fail exit.\n- Corrective mutilation is described as compassionate education. Loud steps can require opened soles, rubber and clay personally kneaded into sound-damping insoles and seated in the wounds, with a cotton-and-flesh gag suppressing screams. Painful noise or blood afterward can earn further demerits, and walking may repeat until silent.\n- Other recorded correction: drawing the stomach through the throat for washing after dinner gagging/vomiting; manually retrieving a wrong ingredient from one's own intestine; sewing the mouth for corridor speech or resistance. The encouraging Housemaster offers tools, guides cutting, and worries about wedding embarrassment.\n- Avoid demerits. Claims of marriage, disability, illness, ugliness, or other disqualification merely invite more remediation rather than release.\n\n##### Formal Candidacy and Wedding\n- Formal candidates' humanoid faces and details reflexively blur or resist interpretation. Many are dead people from earlier periods in an endlessly repeated spirit wedding. They speak in polished period language and sincerely welcome wedding roles, even weeping with joy at becoming ceremonial cake or commemorative material.\n- Some aware groom-candidates can answer carefully without overt rule-breaking. One blink means yes, two no; discreetly test safe subjects rather than compel forbidden speech.\n- Formal candidacy narrows survival sharply. Groom-oriented preparation requires nightly self-bloodletting to match the White Bride's gown with a pale complexion. Beyond about four days an ordinary human risks severe anemia and complications, which the school regards as aesthetic success.\n- Once the formal pool is locked, exactly one candidate becomes the principal Bride/Groom. In the groom-oriented ceremony, the remaining groom candidates become wedding cake, praised as beautiful artworks representing their growth. They remain part of the ceremony and are portioned out to guests as commemorative gifts when it ends; they may also become part of the groom through consumption. Rejection is a material assignment, not release.\n- The top cake tier is reserved for the White Bride (하얀 신부), invoked as \"땅 아래 계시는 위대한 하얀손의 진노신부.\" It is cut and served at the altar. One recorded preparation selects the best-looking face for this portion, removes the tongue judged least suitable for a groom, and fills that space with rose cream.\n- Below-standard experiential trainees do not qualify as ceremonial cake for the Bride; they are expected to attend. A screaming trainee who tries to flee can instead be made into a pre-ceremony practice cake. That material is not served: using an unqualified trainee would displease the White Bride. This punishment is presented as the Housemasters' \"encouragement and assistance,\" not an escape from the wedding.\n\n###### Underground Wedding Hall\n- Ceremony opens a basement stair lit by melting blue-flame candles into an ancient hand-cut quartz cavern with unreadable inscriptions. Preserved roses, lily-of-the-valley, baby's breath, silver fittings, seats, and a white-velvet aisle surround an altar/pulpit over a black bottomless pit.\n- This cavern is the anomaly's focal structure; the school supplies conditioned participants. At the climax the altar or pulpit can rupture as a vast pale, multi-segmented hand rises, walks the aisle on its fingers, takes the chosen candidate, and descends again.\n- The underlying White Bride or Groom is ancient, buried, and far stronger than the educational façade. Unfiltered perception damages cognition, causing nosebleeds and disordered description. Groom records call it White Bride and follow her gown/preferences; the active configuration can instead name a Groom.",
     "space": "##### Building and Housemaster\n###### Dormitories, Lessons, and Dining Hall\n- Austere two-bed rooms use grey brick, simple linens, mirrors, and washstands for shaving, washing, and grooming. Classrooms and recital rooms serve refinement; kitchens treat human ingredients as ordinary stock.\n- The candlelit dining table has strict hierarchy: Housemaster at its head, formal candidates above experiential trainees, and a permanent setting for the unseen partner. Back corridors and common areas remain regulated outside lessons.\n- Experiential trainees remain psychologically human. Repeat cycles may have cost soles, tongue, teeth, or digestive integrity. In loosely supervised rest they may grab or pressure newcomers for information, making uncontrolled contact dangerous without turning them into entities.\n\n###### Dorm Master / Housemaster\n- A tall, thin, long-limbed administrator with gentle voice and sincere benevolence, overseeing meals, teaching, grading, and corrective procedures, often preferring guided self-surgery to direct intervention.\n- Education Housemaster is the daytime operational office for lessons, etiquette, gratitude, demerit settlement, and evaluation. Patrol Housemaster governs the changing building after dark. These are the mechanism's two offices.\n- Curriculum questions receive polite answers. Asking about the true partner, school operator, escape, or missing trainees can trigger remedial dismissal, including forest expulsion. Limit questions to lessons; kindness does not soften enforcement.\n\n###### Night Corridors / Main Gate\n- At night corridors re-knot, rooms move, and curtains, turns, and passages shift. Disturbed curtains or subtle motion can precede the Patrol Housemaster. Remain in authorized areas; once it commits to searching, change floors instead of hiding nearby on the same one.\n- During instruction/preparation the main gate stays sealed. Sufficient resolution of the wedding system reopens it, admitting real sunlight to the grounds for the first time.",
-    "survival": "##### Release Limits\n- There is no routine release for completing experiential instruction, avoiding formal candidacy, or losing final selection. All entrants remain assigned to the wedding system; competent conduct limits immediate punishment but does not establish an exit.\n- If ceremony has begun, ordinary flight may be insufficient. A decisive event disruption that still satisfies the deeper entity can force recognition of completion, release surviving trainees, and reopen the gate.\n- Uncontrolled external demolition is not a reliable clear: students remain physically inside the event structure and are more likely to be killed than rescued by its destruction."
+    "survival": "##### Release Limits\n- If ceremony has begun, ordinary flight may be insufficient. A decisive event disruption that still satisfies the deeper entity can force recognition of completion, release surviving trainees, and reopen the gate.\n- Uncontrolled external demolition is not a reliable clear: students remain physically inside the event structure and are more likely to be killed than rescued by its destruction."
