     "doctrine": "##### Doctrine of Force\n- Immediate firepower: mass agents in black suits and sunglasses, submachine guns first, and a professional Sword Corps for what bullets cannot solve.\n- Civilian policy: no survivors are left in a corrupted zone. Any civilian may be foreign matter wearing a face, and any true human still inside is already lost.\n- Public policy: the truth is suppressed because \"the more who know, the worse it gets.\"\n- Anomalous powers and their users: all supernatural abilities, entities, organizations, and practitioners are classified as foreign matter or its collaborators, regardless of whether they call their power miracle, faith, commerce, or sorcery. Parley is forbidden and engagement is authorized.",
     "hq": "##### Headquarters\n- HQ Location: Jongno-gu, Seoul\n- Headquarters is a large office building staffed wall to wall with black suits. It contains administration, team offices, the armory, auditorium, underground hall, a vast indoor training complex where the Sword Corps drills, and sealed basement corridors leading to the Database chamber.",
