     "intro": "The militant holy arm of Islam, whose champions summon legions of warrior spirits from Mecca. Like the Vatican it overwhelms sorcery as a matter of natural law, and the two share a standing blood-feud.\n\n- The militant holy arm of Islam, fielding jihad crusaders against supernatural threats; its apex operatives rank among the most dangerous individuals on the planet\n- Commands legions of warrior spirits: Mamluk heavy cavalry and crusader hosts summoned from Mecca, whose reserves are described as endless as fish in the ocean\n- Mecca functions as the faction's sanctum and arsenal; its champions can summon designated enemies to Mecca itself for judgment and execution\n- Clergy of this faction, like the Vatican's, hard-counter sorcerers; the mage world's failure to rise is attributed directly to the priesthoods' one-sided advantage over them\n- Standing blood-feud with the Vatican; the Management Bureau classifies the faction as untouchable, with standing orders to flee on sight of its champion"
