   "흡혈귀": {
    "keys": "Vampires, 흡혈귀, Secriem, 세크리엠",
    "fields": {
     "intro": "An ancient bloodline power under the True Ancestor, expanding by turning humans into ghouls and raising the chosen into vampires. Its society is riven by factional and territorial struggle. The Vatican hunts it, and the classic banes hold in full.\n\n- An ancient bloodline power structured around the True Ancestor at its apex, descending through elder vampires to fledglings and ghouls; vampires convert humans by bite into ghouls, and cultivate chosen ghouls upward into true vampires\n- Vampire society is intensely political: factions, territorial claims, and independence bids are constant, and powerful individuals surface publicly when building their own power bases\n- Standard vampiric capabilities include superhuman speed sufficient to dodge gunfire on reaction, bat-swarm dispersal, blood-blade projection, regeneration through feeding, and mass hypnosis via ocular wave\n- Classic banes apply with full force: garlic, holy power, and blessed implements; silver wounds but does not decide; sunlight constrains operations\n- Hunted by the Vatican as a standing mandate and monitored by the Management Bureau; a True Ancestor-level manifestation is treated by every faction as a regional catastrophe in progress"
