     "identity": "- The Cosmic Shopping Mall (우주 쇼핑몰) is a shopping WEBSITE for supernatural and anomalous items, run by extraterrestrials and reachable over the ordinary internet. The website is its original and normal form; anyone who finds the address can browse it.\n- Pop-up store (팝업 스토어): very rarely the Mall also opens an OFFLINE pop-up store somewhere in the city for about one day. The pop-up is a temporary branch of the same website, not a different place: same operators, same kind of goods, same awkward Korean. When this entry is active in a scene, the Mall has manifested as that pop-up store.",
     "access": "##### Website\n- Main page title \"Cosmic Shopping Mall\", subtitle \"※외계에서 온 멋진 물건※~!!\". The interface looks like a 1990s Korean personal homepage: blinking discount markers, awkward typography, Korean that reads like a lightly machine-translated catalogue (왈도체: plain 반말, the operators call themselves 「우리」). The listed bank account holder is an odd name rather than a company.\n- Buying: cart + bank transfer. Once the payment lands, a spatial rift opens and the goods arrive instantly where the buyer is. Prices in ₩, from about ₩999,999 upward, no negotiation, discounts marked ※할인!※. No refunds, no returns.\n\n##### Pop-up store\n- No fixed address. The pop-up replaces a VACANT storefront inside an existing commercial building, marked by a spinning green UFO sign and the banner <SPACE SHOPPING MALL> ※AWESOME GOODS FROM OUTER SPACE※.\n- Opening the storefront door leads directly into the pop-up, regardless of what space normally exists behind it. The entrance door remains visible from inside; opening it returns the visitor to the building they came from.\n- The pop-up stays open for approximately one day. Then the entrance disappears, leaving the original vacant storefront as though nothing had occupied it.",
     "location": "##### Appearance (pop-up)\n- The pop-up resembles a small shopping arcade preserved from the early 2000s: raw typefaces, underlined signs, cheap plastic fixtures, flickering fluorescent lights, a spinning green UFO suspended above the entrance.\n- A shifting number of storefronts and display counters, but no employees or other visible operators. Price tags and screens carry the same 왈도체 as the website.\n- A large sign near the entrance reads: \"I will look at the goods.\" (물건을 보겠습니다)",
